---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
---

<DocsLayout title="Deployment">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Docker / GHCR"
    title={id ? 'Deployment production' : 'Production deployment'}
    description={id ? 'Image production menggabungkan backend Express dan build React menjadi satu container non-root. Production memerlukan storage persisten dan hanya satu instance aktif untuk satu volume/account.' : 'The production image combines the Express backend and compiled React frontend into one non-root container. Production requires persistent storage and exactly one active instance for one volume/account.'}
  />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">GHCR</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="image" code={`ghcr.io/howlil/wago-simple:latest\nghcr.io/howlil/wago-simple:main\nghcr.io/howlil/wago-simple:sha-<short-sha>\nghcr.io/howlil/wago-simple:<semver>`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Nama image wago-simple dipertahankan sebagai identifier distribusi saat ini meskipun repository bernama howlil/wago. Workflow release membangun linux/amd64 dan linux/arm64, menghasilkan SBOM/provenance, lalu push manifest ke GHCR.' : 'The wago-simple image name remains the current distribution identifier even though the repository is howlil/wago. The release workflow builds linux/amd64 and linux/arm64, generates SBOM/provenance, and pushes the manifest to GHCR.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Kepemilikan tag deterministik' : 'Deterministic tag ownership'}>
    {id ? 'Hanya build branch main yang dapat memperbarui latest, main, dan sha-* milik branch. Build tag v* hanya mempublikasikan tag versi/semver sehingga tag release lama tidak dapat menggeser latest ke commit lama.' : 'Only main-branch builds can update latest, main, and branch-owned sha-* tags. v* tag builds publish only version/semver tags, so an older release tag cannot move latest back to an older commit.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Docker Compose</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Fresh production tidak lagi membutuhkan SETUP_TOKEN. Saat gateway belum memiliki credential, Wago membuat one-time setup code, menyimpan hanya hash-nya di SQLite, dan mencetak plaintext sekali ke deployment log.' : 'Fresh production no longer requires SETUP_TOKEN. When the gateway has no credential, Wago creates a one-time setup code, stores only its hash in SQLite, and prints the plaintext once to deployment logs.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`git clone https://github.com/howlil/wago.git\ncd wago\ndocker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose ps\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:3000/health\ndocker compose logs wago | grep "first-run setup code"`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-4">{id ? 'Buka dashboard, klik Pair WhatsApp, lalu masukkan setup code terbaru dari deployment/container log. Setelah bootstrap berhasil, setup code di-invalidasi, generated API key menjadi credential machine/recovery utama, dan pairing QR dilanjutkan. Bila container restart sebelum bootstrap selesai, gunakan code terbaru dari log.' : 'Open the dashboard, click Pair WhatsApp, then enter the latest setup code from deployment/container logs. After bootstrap succeeds, the setup code is invalidated, the generated API key becomes the primary machine/recovery credential, and QR pairing continues. If the container restarts before bootstrap completes, use the newest code from logs.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Network default sengaja tetap' : 'Network default is intentionally fixed'}>
    {id ? 'Compose mem-publish 127.0.0.1:3000. Letakkan Caddy, Nginx, Traefik, Cloudflare Tunnel, atau router PaaS di depannya dan gunakan HTTPS ketika service diakses di luar localhost.' : 'Compose publishes 127.0.0.1:3000. Put Caddy, Nginx, Traefik, Cloudflare Tunnel, or a PaaS router in front of it and use HTTPS when the service is accessed outside localhost.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Pre-provisioned API key opsional' : 'Optional pre-provisioned API key'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`export API_KEY="$(openssl rand -hex 32)"\ndocker compose up -d`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Gunakan jalur ini bila deployment platform/secret manager sudah memiliki ownership provisioning. Bila API_KEY ada, first-run setup code tidak dibuat. SETUP_TOKEN masih diterima hanya sebagai compatibility override untuk deployment lama dan tidak diperlukan pada deployment baru.' : 'Use this path when a deployment platform or secret manager already owns provisioning. When API_KEY exists, no first-run setup code is created. SETUP_TOKEN is still accepted only as a compatibility override for older deployments and is not required for new deployments.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Hardening container' : 'Container hardening'}</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-8">
    <li>{id ? 'Runtime berjalan sebagai user node, bukan root.' : 'Runtime runs as the node user, not root.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Root filesystem read-only; /tmp memakai tmpfs.' : 'Read-only root filesystem with /tmp on tmpfs.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Semua Linux capabilities di-drop.' : 'All Linux capabilities are dropped.'}</li>
    <li><code>no-new-privileges:true</code></li>
    <li>{id ? 'Data persisten hanya melalui named volume wago_data pada /app/data.' : 'Persistent data goes through the wago_data named volume at /app/data.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Production fail closed bila /app/data hanya berada pada root overlay, tmpfs, atau ramfs.' : 'Production fails closed when /app/data is backed only by root overlay, tmpfs, or ramfs.'}</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">{id ? 'Satu active instance' : 'Single active instance'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Wago tetap single-account/single-active-instance. SQLite menyimpan lease pendek yang di-heartbeat selama proses berjalan. Container kedua yang menunjuk volume yang sama ditolak dengan WAGO_INSTANCE_ALREADY_ACTIVE.' : 'Wago remains single-account/single-active-instance. SQLite stores a short lease that is heartbeated while the process runs. A second container pointing at the same volume is rejected with WAGO_INSTANCE_ALREADY_ACTIVE.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Jangan rolling overlap pada volume yang sama' : 'Do not roll overlapping replicas on the same volume'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Gunakan replica=1 dan strategi stop-old-before-start-new untuk session Baileys ini. Lease adalah guardrail terakhir, bukan alasan untuk menjalankan active-active.' : 'Use replica=1 and stop-old-before-start-new for this Baileys session. The lease is a final guardrail, not permission to run active-active.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Reverse proxy, TLS, dan origin' : 'Reverse proxy, TLS, and origin'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Gunakan satu origin HTTPS untuk dashboard dan API bila memungkinkan. Wago tidak memiliki configurable CORS allowlist. Production bootstrap memvalidasi Origin HTTPS + host yang sama dan juga membutuhkan possession atas one-time setup code saat gateway belum memiliki credential.' : 'Prefer one HTTPS origin for dashboard and API. Wago does not expose a configurable CORS allowlist. Production bootstrap validates HTTPS same-origin and also requires possession of the one-time setup code while the gateway has no credential.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Setup code adalah secret sementara' : 'The setup code is a temporary secret'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Deployment log fresh instance berisi plaintext setup code sampai bootstrap selesai. Batasi akses log. Wago tidak menyimpan plaintext tersebut ke SQLite, browser storage, atau audit event.' : 'Fresh-instance deployment logs contain the plaintext setup code until bootstrap completes. Restrict log access. Wago does not persist that plaintext to SQLite, browser storage, or audit events.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Persistence</h2>
  <div class="border border-[#262626] rounded-lg divide-y divide-[#262626] text-sm mb-8">
    <div class="p-4"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">/app/data/wago.db</code><p class="text-[#71717a] mt-1">{id ? 'SQLite application state: App ID/API-key hash, one-time setup-code hash selama bootstrap, browser sessions, binding, recipient policy, outbound safety, webhook queue/settings, instance lease, migration metadata, dan structured audit event.' : 'SQLite application state: App ID/API-key hash, one-time setup-code hash during bootstrap, browser sessions, binding, recipient policy, outbound safety, webhook queue/settings, instance lease, migration metadata, and structured audit events.'}</p></div>
    <div class="p-4"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">/app/data/wago.db-wal</code> / <code class="text-[#fafafa]">wago.db-shm</code><p class="text-[#71717a] mt-1">{id ? 'File runtime SQLite saat WAL mode aktif. Gunakan controlled stop/checkpoint sebelum filesystem backup.' : 'SQLite runtime files while WAL mode is active. Use a controlled stop/checkpoint before a filesystem backup.'}</p></div>
    <div class="p-4"><code class="text-[#fafafa]">/app/data/auth/</code><p class="text-[#71717a] mt-1">{id ? 'Baileys multi-file credential/session state. Perlakukan seperti private key.' : 'Baileys multi-file credential/session state. Treat it like a private key.'}</p></div>
  </div>

  <Callout title={id ? 'Yang tetap transient' : 'What remains transient'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Current QR/connection/reconnect state, account-health cache, recent-message content, dan message-status cache dibangun ulang setelah proses restart. Jangan menjadikan state transient sebagai alasan menaruh /app/data di writable layer container.' : 'Current QR/connection/reconnect state, the account-health cache, recent-message content, and message-status cache are rebuilt after restart. Transient state is not a reason to place /app/data on the container writable layer.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'WhatsApp Web version saat pairing' : 'WhatsApp Web version during pairing'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-8">{id ? 'Ketika membuat socket baru, Wago mencoba resolve versi WhatsApp Web terbaru melalui Baileys. Jika lookup gagal, lifecycle melanjutkan dengan versi default/bundled Baileys.' : 'When creating a new socket, Wago attempts to resolve the latest WhatsApp Web version through Baileys. If lookup fails, the lifecycle continues with the Baileys default/bundled version.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">{id ? 'Upgrade dari JSON store lama' : 'Upgrade from the legacy JSON store'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-8">{id ? 'Pada startup pertama setelah upgrade, Wago mengimpor legacy state ke wago.db dalam satu transaksi dan menyimpan import marker. File JSON lama tidak dihapus otomatis agar tetap tersedia sebagai recovery artifact.' : 'On the first startup after upgrading, Wago imports legacy state into wago.db in one transaction and records an import marker. Legacy JSON files are not deleted automatically and remain available as recovery artifacts.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">Backup & restore</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Backup filesystem harus mengambil seluruh /app/data dari satu snapshot setelah service berhenti, bukan hanya menyalin wago.db dari container live.' : 'A filesystem backup must capture the entire /app/data from one snapshot after the service stops, not just copy wago.db from a live container.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`docker compose stop wago\nVOLUME=$(docker inspect "$(docker compose ps -aq wago)" --format '{{range .Mounts}}{{if eq .Destination "/app/data"}}{{.Name}}{{end}}{{end}}')\nmkdir -p backups\ndocker run --rm \\\n  -v "$VOLUME:/data:ro" \\\n  -v "$PWD/backups:/backup" \\\n  alpine:3.22 tar -C /data -czf /backup/wago-data.tgz .\nchmod 600 backups/wago-data.tgz\ndocker compose start wago`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-4">{id ? 'Untuk restore, hentikan Wago, pulihkan archive ke volume kosong/target yang benar, verifikasi permission, lalu start tepat satu instance. Lakukan restore rehearsal berkala pada environment terisolasi.' : 'For restore, stop Wago, restore the archive into the intended empty/target volume, verify permissions, then start exactly one instance. Rehearse restores periodically in an isolated environment.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Backup adalah secret-bearing artifact' : 'Backups are secret-bearing artifacts'} tone="danger">
    {id ? 'Archive berisi WhatsApp auth dan webhook signing secret. Bila backup dibuat ketika gateway belum diinisialisasi, archive juga dapat berisi setup-code hash aktif. Batasi akses/enkripsi sesuai threat model dan jangan upload ke CI artifact, issue, atau repository.' : 'The archive contains WhatsApp auth and the webhook signing secret. If backed up before gateway initialization, it can also contain an active setup-code hash. Restrict access/encrypt it for your threat model and never upload it to CI artifacts, issues, or repositories.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">Upgrade</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`docker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">{id ? 'Compose default memakai latest. Untuk deployment reproducible, pin release semver atau immutable digest. Jangan gunakan docker compose down -v untuk upgrade normal.' : 'Compose defaults to latest. For reproducible deployment, pin a semver release or immutable digest. Do not use docker compose down -v for a normal upgrade.'}</p>
</DocsLayout>
